      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 6.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "okay good morning come in have a a seat in your own words what's happened?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.39,
      "end_seconds": 15.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "um, it's an upset stomach in the mornings i thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.84,
      "end_seconds": 19.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.27,
      "end_seconds": 29.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Omeprazole, 20 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.55,
      "end_seconds": 34.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.57,
      "end_seconds": 39.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "so, no, it's at home"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.23,
      "end_seconds": 51.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Roughly when did it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.84,
      "end_seconds": 60.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "It's been six months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.18,
      "end_seconds": 64.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "on a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.15,
      "end_seconds": 70.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.58,
      "end_seconds": 74.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How often does it happen?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.3,
      "end_seconds": 79.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I'd say a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.53,
      "end_seconds": 82.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "have you had poor sleep?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "yes, for six months. I've, I've had morning shakiness too, for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.06,
      "end_seconds": 95.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "have you been feeling guilty about it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.5,
      "end_seconds": 102.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "yes, for about two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.26,
      "end_seconds": 109.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "did you get vomiting blood, thoughts of harming myself, blackouts or seizures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.03,
      "end_seconds": 117.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "no vomiting blood thoughts of harming myself blackouts or seizures none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.13,
      "end_seconds": 120.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Okay. Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.55,
      "end_seconds": 126.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.51,
      "end_seconds": 132.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "what about family history any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.98,
      "end_seconds": 140.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "my father had kidney stones my mother had high blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.03,
      "end_seconds": 151.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.77,
      "end_seconds": 159.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I had my gallbladder removed in 2016"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.38,
      "end_seconds": 164.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.39,
      "end_seconds": 177.6,
      "duration_seconds": 11.21,
      "text": "hmm there was some antibiotic I was told I was allergic but I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.03,
      "end_seconds": 184.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "moving on to your background any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.44,
      "end_seconds": 196.6,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "well, I've had acid reflux for about a year now i just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.13,
      "end_seconds": 205.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.24,
      "end_seconds": 222.16,
      "duration_seconds": 14.92,
      "text": "I don't drink at all. I smoke about ten cigarettes a day. It's just me and my wife at home now. I'm a software engineer, so I'm at a screen all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 235.26,
      "end_seconds": 245.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier spO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 86, BP is 122 over 76, temp 36.7 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.72,
      "end_seconds": 247.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.19,
      "end_seconds": 251.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.58,
      "end_seconds": 255.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "hold that that position for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.85,
      "end_seconds": 269.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "hands show a fine tremor and your abdomen is soft with no tenderness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.24,
      "end_seconds": 286.72,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "good that's the the examination. Just to be sure I understood. You've had an upset stomach in the mornings for six months and no seizures or vomiting blood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.42,
      "end_seconds": 293.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.87,
      "end_seconds": 309.41,
      "duration_seconds": 13.54,
      "text": "let's get liver function tests for alcohol use let's get blood tests for alcohol use plan a few alcohol-free days each week and track how much you drink"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.69,
      "end_seconds": 310.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "yes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.98,
      "end_seconds": 315.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "We'll refer you to the alcohol support service."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.86,
      "end_seconds": 318.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "alright, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.48,
      "end_seconds": 328.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.13,
      "text": "and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit so we can settle the dose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.3,
      "end_seconds": 332.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "okay, I understand"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.71,
      "end_seconds": 339.23,
